{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"+ (","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:v","text":"void","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"checkIfEligibleForSurvey","kind":"identifier"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"languages":["occ"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In order to be eligible, a number of conditions must be fulfilled:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The library is in an enabled state. If the user has previously declined an invite","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"or completed a survey, the library will be in a disabled state. Otherwise, the library is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"in an enabled state.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The user has met the loyalty threshold defined in your exp_configuration.json file."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The user is in the sampling pool. If the previous two conditions have been met, the library"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"makes an HTTP call to our servers to determine if the user is in the sampling pool. If s\/he is,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the invite will be presented. If not, the invite will not be shown. Disable this remote check with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"setSkipPoolingCheck:","isActive":true}]}]}],"type":"orderedList"}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Checks to see if the user is currently eligible to be invited to a survey."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.Verint.EXPPredictive\/documentation\/EXPPredictive","doc:\/\/com.Verint.EXPPredictive\/documentation\/EXPPredictive\/EXPPredictive"]]},"sections":[],"